    "title": "Lawsuit against former BHHS teacher will proceed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tabor Brewster ,\n3 hours ago On June 24, a Los Angeles County Superior Court judge denied an anti-SLAPP motion filed by former Beverly Hills High School journalism teacher Romeo Carey, allowing defamation claims made by former Beverly Hills Unified School District administrator Mark Mead against Carey to move forward. California’s anti-SLAPP law allows defendants to... Read full article",
